---
import { t, changeLanguage } from "i18next";
import { localizePath } from "astro-i18next";
import { Trans } from "astro-i18next/components";
import Layout from "../../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
import Tape from "../../components/Tape.vue";

changeLanguage("en");
---

<style>
	:root {
		--blood: #ff0000;
		--lunarian: #26afff;

		--blood_dark: #ff0000;
		--blood_light: #00ffff;
		--lunarian_dark: #26afff;
		--lunarian_light: #d95000;
	}

	#queen {
		font-family: "Times for Punks";
		font-style: normal;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--lunarian);
		line-height: 1.5rem;
	}

	#blood {
		color: var(--blood);
	}

	#nixon {
		font-family: "Astigma";
		font-style: normal;
		font-size: 1.03rem;
		line-height: 1.375rem;
	}
</style>
<Layout
	title={t("nixon.title")}
	heroImage="../../../images/data/nv_dark.png"
	description={t("nixon.desc")}
>
	<p>
		THE NIXONVERSE is a tale developed by MISTER MANTICORE (Alex Casanas)
		via YouTube in 2022. The series is a Spin-Off of his main story,
		<a href={localizePath("data/monument-mythos")}>THE MONUMENT MYTHOS</a>,
		and an expansion for one of Alex oldest videos, <a
			href={localizePath("data/house-in-the-ocean")}
			id="hid">THE HOUSE IN THE OCEAN</a
		>. <br /><br /> In 2023 it got an expansion called “<a
			href="https://youtu.be/aUbsgWa2CXY"
			target="_blank">THE ABSOLUTE NIXONVERSE</a
		>”, and a trailer for <a
			href="https://youtu.be/LjfKyuzwfqc"
			target="_blank">a 2 season</a
		> was uploaded as an April Fools joke.
	</p>
	<h1>{t("data.syn")}</h1>
	<p>
		The series take place after the events of the second season of MONUMENT
		MYTHOS, in a different universe with a fairly familiar form; the story
		connects three <b
			>containers for God's <u>GOODNESS</u>, <u>WILL</u> and <u
				>AUTHORITY</u
			></b
		>, who slowly become mad thanks to one simple thing: <b
			>our world is not kind, <i>our world will never be kind</i></b
		>.
	</p>
	<h1>{t("chrono.chrono")}</h1>
	<ol>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/p18oxjNauM8" target="_blank">
				THE D-DAY KNIGHT</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/VdcCQmMEKtk" target="_blank"
				>THE LAST SON OF ALCATRAZ</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/oWyklL0biuo" target="_blank"
				>THE QUEEN OF THE LUNARIANS</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/DLWmWR8HrdI" target="_blank"
				>JESUS IN VIETNAM</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/vyxYFnxd7Q8" target="_blank"
				>THE MISSING EYE OF JESUS CHRIST</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/IeRZ8USiRKI" target="_blank">
				SEA OF THE LAST SON</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/gsXYUfw_09I" target="_blank"
				>THE D-DAY KNIGHT RETURNS</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/zsZwjmOe2pc" target="_blank">
				D-DAY KNIGHTFALL</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/nYKzDV8T58A" target="_blank">
				NIXON IS GOD</a
			>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://youtu.be/Nmi3ENEOMXQ" target="_blank"
				>THE ED DWIGHT PARADOX</a
			>
		</li>
	</ol>
	<h1>{t("data.inter")}</h1>
	<h3>PROLOGUE - THE END OF ANOTHER WORLD</h3>
	<p>
		Before anything can happen, we need to adress one key element of our
		world, <b>The Nature of Alcatraz Matter</b>: if we put together a
		regular atom and an Alcatraz atom, the particles of the regular one will
		mutate to the properties and characteristics of the Alcatraz one, acting
		similarly to a parasite than anything else. This allegory makes more
		sense knowing that every Alcatraz atom has <b
			>its own mind, brain and neurons</b
		>. Now with knowladge captured, we can <b>wake the Horned Serpent</b>.
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/endofanotherworld_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p>WELCOME TO THE NIXONVERSE</p>
	</blockquote>

	<h3>ACT I - THE CHILDREN OF GOD</h3>
	<p>
		Our story begins with a docummental created by Alice Avenue, talking
		about a hero who turned the fate of the Amercian soldiers that arrived
		to Normandy and accepted death as their destiny. They baptized him as <b
			>The D-Day Knight</b
		>, and prayed that at any time, at any place, he could save us. During
		D-Day, the Knight lost his helmet and when researchers found it in the
		battlefield, it had a lot of damage. Luckly for us, they managed to
		restore it to its full glory... however something looked odd, why a
		knight would have a whole craneum as his helmet? What kind of <i
			>horned creature</i
		> would ever have squeletic formation like that to begin with?
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/hornedhelmet_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p>The D-Day Knight helmet</p>
	</blockquote>
	<p>
		However, he's not the only hero of this land. There's another being
		borned taller than a man, and stil decides to keep himself at the size
		of one, but even he could conquer and hurt us all if he desires to: <b
			>The Last Son of Alcatraz.</b
		> He's just naive and has a great desire to protect humans, he's a better
		hero than the Knight would ever aspire to be.
	</p>
	<p>
		Finally the third container is showed to us, but not in our usual
		planet, this time is somewhere more special... like <i>the Moon.</i>
		<br />
		The Apollo 11 odyssey captured in photos and recordings a woman living on
		the Moon, a queen waiting for her people to come back to her authority: <b
			>The Queen of the Lunarian.</b
		> Before Ed Dwight could step out of the lander and become the first man
		on the Moon, the Queen started a seech that she had prepared for a long time,
		the first ever recorded words on the Moon. Unfortunely a tiny blood stain
		covered the entire moment, as after commanding Ed to blast the Queen, John
		Glenn was <b>evicted from reality</b>.
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<Tape audio="../../../audio/queen's_beauty.mp3" client:only />
		<p id="queen">
			Beuti is soomting els, soomting inxpicble that eech pirson cerriis
			insid. This furm of beuti reeletd tot Her veshions.
			<br /><br />
			Thier's a <u>Greet Dibsion</u> coomig abuut on these planet. Thier arr
			goinn tot be a lut of peepul jhuu wiil die bcos tey just don't nkow jhou
			tot liev. Tey don't nkow waht lif's abuut, tey don't nkow jhow tot giv,
			jhow tot lov - knor do thei wann tot.
			<br /><br />
			Ann thoos jhu are beutifuul enuugh - I don't meen pfiscalee but soomting
			beejon taht - tey wiil haev the chaens tot leern jhow tot fly, tot be
			beutifuul, tot reis avuub the levl of the nnormml jhumn - tot be supeeror
			biigs first ann evntuelii <i>guds ann guddsses.</i>
		</p>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/containers_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
	</blockquote>
	<h3>ACT II - THE HOUSE OF GOD</h3>
	<p>
		A queen for nobody living on the Moon, and the <b>Knight and Day</b> balance
		in between the Knight and the Son, it was just a matter of time for everything
		to go wrong... <i>way too wrong.</i> Going forward, in the middle of the
		Korean War, the Last Son ended up interviening in the name of America, even
		stopping the Knight for going <i style="font-weight: bold;"
			>“<u>too far</u>”.</i
		> Once his job was done, he returned to his fortress on Alaska, fully oblivious
		about the tiny present that followed him home. <b
			>American nuclear missiles</b
		>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Why would the United States kidnap one of their heros? They have a big
		plan, but before it could take place they need something else: thanks to
		the research that Apollo 11 did on Lunarian anatomy, Apollo 12 was
		sended to the Moon with the objective to shoot the Queen and recover her
		eye. Once back on Earth, the big transformation of the Last Son took
		place, he was brainwashed and became a bastardized impersonator of our
		original savior, the one who will bring to our land a distorted vision
		of world peace: <b>Jesus Christ.</b>
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/itwastheonlyway_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p></p>
		<p>
			OUR FREEDOM ᐳ YOUR FREEDOM
			<br />OUR CHRIST ᐳ YOUR CHRIST
			<br />= WORLD PEACE
		</p>
	</blockquote>
	<p>
		With our “Lord” created, tha US sended the Son to theoreticlly redeem
		the rest of the world, starting on Vietnam (now called Bethlenam). They
		started spreading their vision and their power everywhere, like a virus,
		but at some point the Son regained his senses, he opened his eyes
		(well... his one eye) and he saw all the pain he created under the Lord
		mantra. He flew away into his hideout, now called Dark Alaska, and he
		hid inside an imitation of his childhood home: the Son built a house... <b
			>in the ocean.</b
		>
	</p>
	<p style="text-align: center;">
		The House in the Ocean is not an urban legend.<br /><b
			>IT IS A COVER STORY</b
		>
	</p>
	<h3>ACT III - THE THRONE OF GOD</h3>
	<p>
		While all this havoc was happening on Earth, what was going on with the
		Queen? She was hiding inside an empty city underground, remembering all
		the events that brought her at this point, recalling her <b>story</b>.
	</p>
	<p>
		She never knew how she got to the Moon, let alone how she was alive, but
		what she knew is that she was the Queen of... someone. She searched the
		entirety of the Moon and yet, no subjects were found. She hoped deep
		within herself that one day her kingdom would return, and by that time
		she wanted to get everything ready, she wanted her people to find
		confort and equality in her arms. She built a city below the surface,
		with houses, parks, air and her own throne, still no one in sight; until
		finally, after a long time a ship touched the surface of her Moon... but
		she was met with pain. The ship was from the US, and the astronauts
		aboard wanted nothing but <b>her eye.</b> Once they left and still wounded,
		the Queen crawled back to her lonely empire, and when she reached her throne
		something changed, her throne was vandalized and left with a message for
		the Queen:
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<p id="queen" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">
			THE LONESOME QUEEN OF MOON ABOVE<br />
			SHALL BE STRONG FAIR AND KIND<br />
			SHE'LL RULE THE EARTH BOTH FEARED AND LOVED<br />
			WITH KNIGHT AND KING BESIDE<br />
		</p>
	</blockquote>
	<p>
		The time of her lifetime has finally come, soon the <b
			>container of God's <u id="blood">ISOLATION</u></b
		> would leave her empty world to rule a new, better one, whether they accepted
		her... <b>or not.</b>
		<br />
		Out of the clouds of her sky, she crafted a ship and leaved the Moon forever.
		Her new kingdom was calling, but first a quick stop in Dark Alaska, right
		where the House in the Ocean resides. The Queen quickly notices that the
		powers and abilities of the Son were more similar to the King her prophecy
		told, so she invited him to join her kingdom and rule with her... it only
		took one little <b>drastic</b> action for the Son to reclaim his throne.
		He finally got to one final form, he's no longer either a man, a hero or
		the Lord, he was at last... <i>The Crescent King.</i>
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/evolution_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p>Evolution ofthe Last Son.</p>
	</blockquote>
	<h3>ACT IV - THE KNIGHT OF GOD</h3>
	<p>
		Queen and King started “<u id="queen">lunarianizing</u>” humans,
		resembeling the look of their king, with crescent heads and unstable
		anatomy. For those who still were humans, something worse was prepared
		for them, the Lunarians deleted their free choice to join the kingdom or
		rebel against it, they brainwashed them and deleted their culture, their
		language, their spirit. Even in the middle of the storm hope can rise...
		Alice Avenue was back and ready to pray for those who couldn't. Her plan
		was simple, broadcast the story of the Last Son, hoping for him to wake
		up and reverse himself.
	</p>
	<p>
		The Last Son was a young man like you and me, with parents who were
		cutthroats and classmates who were worse. The boy was always alone when
		he went to school, and always in those moments driving towards his
		destiny, he doubted his role in the universe; he always thought that he
		had to help everyone around him, and that he had to win at any cost. One
		day in the midst of his thoughts, the young man was involved in a car
		crash; still strong enough to move, he got out of his car and approached
		the dying man with whom he had collided, a familiar face from another
		universe... <b>James Dean</b>.
	</p>
	<p>
		“You won, little bastard... you won...”, this were the last words of the
		man who in this universe, lost. The Last Son was devastated and could
		not hold back his tears, and from the pain and exhaustion caused by the
		accident, he fainted. He woke up in a strange dream afterwards, where he
		found himself on a cliff with a vehicle driving at high speed towards
		him. He, to avoid the impact, jumped into the void, and began to believe
		more and more that he could fly, that he could beat death... he did it.
		The young man began to fly high, faster than an airplane. It was right
		here that he woke up and flew as far away as possible from the scene of
		the accident. He kept on believing, and kept on winning at any cost in
		order to save everyone. Always up in the sky, <b
			>it's a bird, it's a plane, it's The Last Son of Alcatraz</b
		>
	</p>
	<p>
		Alice not only prayed that the Crescent King would remember the hero he
		was before becoming a <b>container of God's <u id="blood">PAIN</u></b>,
		she also hoped that the Knight would return to save us all again. He
		listened to her words and executed a desperate plan to make the humanity
		of the Last Son wake up again: throw Alice off the top of the Chrysler
		Building hoping that he would rescue her... <b>that never happened</b>.
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/avenuefall_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p>Alice Avenue last moments of life.</p>
	</blockquote>
	<p>
		After the Knight's plan failed in every way, the Lunarians continued
		their plans. It's at this point that the Knight would compose a message
		apologizing for what happened to Alice, and that she was still alive...
		“<a href={localizePath("data/monument-mythos")} id="hid"
			>IN MY WURLD, STATUUES HELLD SOLES</a
		>”. Yet, something inside the Knight left him unsatisfied, something
		made him feel hollow and just angry at himself, at being a terrible
		American and dissapointing his whole country. To try to redeem himself
		he removed the head of the Alice Avenue memorial statue and wear it as
		one of his old helmets; even though he had only worn it for a day
		something in him changed, the only thing that could be seen was his eye,
		full of anger... he become a <b
			>container of God's <u id="blood">RAGE</u></b
		>.
	</p>
	<h3>ACT V - GOD</h3>
	<p>
		Let's go back in time for a bit, when Ed Dwight landed on the Moon. His
		body was found right there, and his autopsy determined that his death
		was caused by his own ray-gun; next to him was a tape which would be
		referred to as “THE MOON GOD”. This tape holds a conversation between Ed
		and someone special, the one behind the existance of the Son, the Knight
		and the Queen: The God of this universe... <b>Richard Nixon.</b>
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<p style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-style: normal;">
			Note: The following audio does not feature the voice of Ed Dwight.
		</p>
		<Tape audio="../../../audio/the_moon_god.mp3" client:only />
		<p id="nixon">
			I REMEMBER WHEN I LEFT THE HORNED SEPRENT.<br />
			I LANDED ON YOUR MOON FIRST.<br />
			I KNEW BETTER THAN TO SET FOOT ON YOUR WORLD.<br />
			I WONDERED WHETER YOU ALL WOULD ACCEPT ME OR NOT.<br />
			TO FIND THE ANSWER, I HAVE RUN AN EXPERIMENT.<br />
			I PRODUCED THREE BEINGS OUT OF MYSELF.<br />
			THE SON, THE KNIGHT, AND THE QUEEN.<br />
			ALL THREE OF THEM ARE EXTENSIONS OF ME.<br />
			THEY ARE MEANT TO TEST YOUR WORLD.<br />
			BUT THEY WILL GO MAD, EACH IN THEIR OWN WAY.<br />
			YOUR WORLD IS NOT KIND TO THEM.<br />
			YOUR WORLD WILL NEVER BE KIND.<br />
			THEIR SACRIFICE WILL MAKE ME REALIZE THAT I CAN NEVER RISK STEPPING FOOT
			ON EARTH EITHER.<br />
			THE CLOSEST I WILL EVER BE TO YOUR WORLD IS RIGHT HERE, ON THE MOON.<br
			/>
			ONE MORE THING.<br />
			IT IS INEVITABLE THAT THE SON WILL BECOME THE KING OF THE LUNARIANS.<br
			/>
			ONCE HIS TRANSFORMATION IS COMPLETE, I MUST DESTROY HIM, FOR HE WILL
			BE ONE OF THE MOST DANGEROUS LEADERS IN THE UNIVERSE.<br />
			THE KING MUST PERISH.<br />
			I AM SORRY, MR. DWIGHT.<br />
			NO HUMAN WAS EVER MEANT TO HEAR WHAT I HAVE SAID.
		</p>
		<img src="../../../images/data/god_dark.png" class="logo toggleable" />
		<p>“PHOTOGRAPH OF GOD”<br />by Ed Dwight</p>
	</blockquote>
	<!-- 
	-->
	<p>
		In the present time, the prophecy is still missing one final being for
		the Lunarian kingdom to be whole: the Knight. Telepathically, the Queen
		tries to convince him to leave the land that broke him and join the
		kingdom as Prince. However, the Knight, amidst all the anger he has,
		still remember the words of Alice, that “at any time, at any place, the
		Knight could SAVE US”, and unleashes a final movement that would restore
		the damages made by the Lunarians, he exploded his soul into pure
		Alcatraz matter, wich started to attack the Lunarian bodies, destroy the
		cloud ships and restore human culture: <b>ALCATRAZ CHECKMATE</b>.
	</p>
	<p>
		However, there is still the King, who has finally become aware of all he
		has done, and breaks down in tears once again. Grief made him a monster
		and he just wants to dissapear from his own misery, but in an instant,
		he mutates again, becoming a way <a
			href="https://youtu.be/_x9_I2xgU04"
			id="hid">too dangerous</a
		> creature, exactly what Nixon feared he would become... <b
			><u>THE HORNED SERPENT LIVES</u></b
		>.
	</p>
	<blockquote>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/thehornedserpentlives_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
		<p
			style="font-family: 'VCR'; font-style: normal; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--blood);"
		>
			THE HORNED SERPENT LIVES.
		</p>
	</blockquote>
	<p>
		Nixon must act fast, he can't let it all end like his own world ended,
		so he decided to render everything as fiction, the same way our monsters
		became nothing but urban legends. That's how this whole world was
		fictionalized, and became a comic known as “The Nixonverse”, with an
		endearing story made by a certain “Mister Manticore” and beautifully
		illustrated by... <b>Ed Dwight?</b>
	</p>
	<p>
		Compared to Nixon, Ed Dwight was twice the God he was, Nixon was just
		one of many survivors who erased the past, to run from the present. Ed
		was everything Nixon wasn't, someone bold, kind and good. He never went
		to the Moon, let alone talked to a God, he is today in our world
		creating monuments... <i>Ed Dwight preserves the past.</i>
	</p>
	<a
		href="https://twitter.com/MagicBunnyStar/status/1555336147139715076"
		target="_blank"
	>
		<img
			src="../../../images/data/preservethepast_dark.png"
			class="logo toggleable"
		/>
	</a>
</Layout>
